lace-gpui — NOTICE

This crate is a Rust port of parts of Lace, the PySide6 docking system.

  Lace: https://github.com/opticsWolf/Lace
  Copyright (c) 2026 opticsWolf
  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Ported files and their sources (all Apache-2.0, © opticsWolf):

  src/color.rs     <- lace/color_science.py   (OKLab/OKLCH colour math)
  src/contrast.rs  <- lace/theme_contrast.py  (contrast & separation rulebook)
  src/engine.rs    <- lace/dock_theme.py      (ThemeSpec + build pipeline)
  src/themes.rs    <- lace/dock_custom_theme.py (the sixteen palettes + chassis)
  src/skin.rs      <- original bridge code (this crate)

The OKLab constants come from Björn Ottosson's OKLab (published 2020,
https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/), used by Lace's colour science and
by this port in the same matrix form.

